# LoD2 geometry of the Cité des Gratte-Ciel and its surroundings.
#
# Extracted from the UD-Graph dataset GratteCiel_2018_split_v3 (3D city
#     model of the Gratte-Ciel area, CityGML 3.0, EPSG:3946): the buildings
#     whose centre lies within 200 m of the four documented buildings
#     BU_69266BO56_0 … _3.
#
# Rewritten with the CityOWL CWA 3.0 vocabulary: each building is bounded by
#     its roof and wall surfaces, each surface has a LoD2 multi-surface
#     (core:AbstractThematicSurface.lod2MultiSurface, a sub-property of
#     geo:hasGeometry) given as a GeoSPARQL GML literal. The GML is unchanged
#     except for its srsName (EPSG:3946), added so the literal carries its
#     coordinate reference system; heights are those of the source.
#
# Individual IRIs are those of the source, so this geometry joins the
#     reference targets of gratteciel-documents.ttl.

@prefix bldg: <https://dataset-dl.liris.cnrs.fr/rdf-owl-urban-data-ontologies/Ontologies/CityOWL/CWA/3.0/building#> .
